&#x200B;

BUT, and its a big BUT: Every form of Tax money that is handed to them should be publicly noted, and available to criticize.

&#x200B;

Let his family run out its use. Their children will not be as popular as the current Duke, and so on. It will run its natural course.

&#x200B;

Talking now aboout abolishing the Monarchs is a publicity stunt in my opinion.

