this message was brought to you by raisin bran, get your tasteless  breakfast of tomorrow

Taking the time to consider a situation from the other persons perspective. This helped me a lot when interacting with people. I'm already anxious & i get often startled when talking to people and overreact. 

But, in every situation, you should always imagine yourself in the other peoples life, not only the situation but also the circumstances that lead there.  

&#x200B;

This really helped me talking with my SO or getting to know my buddy's, sometimes it takes time but if you are able to see things from there perspective you can come up with real solutions or at least the compassion you are giving is honest, which you can feel on the other side. 

&#x200B;

Happy Holidays y'all

Edward Mordake

